WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.902 --> 00:00:19.710
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:26.999
Tap Instructor, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:30.190
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:34.415
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.415 --> 00:00:40.437
Type your six digits.

6
00:00:40.437 --> 00:00:45.810
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:51.389
This is the Instructor Panel. Five tabs across the top.

8
00:00:51.389 --> 00:00:57.210
Open the Add New tab.

9
00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:02.982
The top row adds one person. The box below adds a list.

10
00:01:02.982 --> 00:01:09.718
One attendee per line: last name, first name, phone.

11
00:01:09.718 --> 00:01:16.200
A preview appears as you type, so you can check it first.

12
00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:21.772
The count above the button says what will be added.

13
00:01:21.772 --> 00:01:27.122
Tap Add.

14
00:01:27.122 --> 00:01:35.433
The line underneath says what happened. Names are never duplicated.
